'''Ursamajor''' (クマンチュー, ''Kumanchū'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Teacher Bear]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

