==Enemy==
Compared to Teacher Bear, Ursamajor is twice as fast, attacks more frequently, has a lower knockback count and strengthens by 100% upon losing half of his health. Thankfully, his range is no different from Teacher Bear's, so [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can still be relied on against him.

==Strategy==
Do not underestimate Ursamajor, as he can push a lot at higher magnifications due to his Strengthen, high damage and lack of backswing. In fact, he can deal up to '''36,000 damage''' at 1,800% magnification when strengthened, as seen in [[Mysterious Order]]. [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocat]] work excellently against Ursamajor, as they can slow him and prevent him from advancing. Don't forget he also has quite the low health, even at higher magnifications.

