==Trivia==
*The [[wikipedia:Ursa Major|Ursa Major]] is a constellation that multiple cultures believe to look like a bear, which echoes with the enemy's cosmic theme.
*His Japanese name, Kumanchū, may be derived from ''[[Kumanchu Royale]]'' and 宇宙 ''uchū'' (outer space; the cosmos).
*His appearance somewhat resembles ''[[wikia:dragon-ball|Dragon Ball]]''<nowiki/>'s [[wikipedia:Frieza|Frieza]].
*Even though Ursamajor works at [[NASA (Into the Future)|NASA]], he never appears there in any chapter.
**However, since Ursamajor wishes to stow away on a rocket, this could have explained his absence—he was either attempting to or has done so successfully.
**His appearance in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and in the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] might confirm that he was able to sneak in a rocket successfully.
*Due to a mistake possibly stemming from syntax maintenance in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]]'s [[Enemy Guide]], Ursamajor's traits were incorrectly listed as "([[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]])" from [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]] to [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] in the English version.

